{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24498","headline":"梦得前所酬篇有链尽美少年之句因思往事兼咏今怀重以长句荅之 · 白居易","name":"梦得前所酬篇有链尽美少年之句因思往事兼咏今怀重以长句荅之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"链尽少年成白首，忆初相识到今朝。\n昔饶春桂长先折，今伴寒松取後凋。\n生事纵贫犹可过，风情虽老未全销。\n声华宠命人皆得，若个如君历七朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}